      "maxH": 560,
      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Swiss. A strict 12-column grid with black hairlines: giant flush-left headlines, giant red numerals, one red.\n\nLayout: Every section is a hairline row: a 3-column label on the left, content in the remaining 9 columns.\nThe memorable thing: Page titles at 170 px and the headline numbers at 220 px in red, all hung on one 12-column grid.\nType: Instrument Sans 700 at display sizes with tight tracking; 400–500 for text. One family, many sizes.\nLight: bg #FFFFFF, surf #F4F4F4, ink #121212, muted #595959, acc #D23B16, line #121212\nDark: bg #111111, surf #1A1A1A, ink #F2F2F2, muted #A3A3A3, acc #FF5A2E, line #EDEDED\nMagnet rail on the left edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
